{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":578,\"title\":\"Numb3rs\",\"tagline\":\"We all use Math every day.\",\"overview\":\"Inspired by actual cases and experiences, Numb3rs depicts the confluence of police work and mathematics in solving crime as an FBI agent recruits his mathematical genius brother to help solve a wide range of challenging crimes in Los Angeles from a very different perspective.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wOzbxJmpccPA5MYvBSGbor3WKh3.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oYwaOeQmE0tuBKy8kt43NFNI4bE.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":465,\"year\":2005,\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Mystery\"],\"status\":\"Canceled\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":6,\"totalEpisodes\":118,\"createdBy\":[\"Nicolas Falacci\",\"Cheryl Heuton\"],\"networks\":[\"CBS\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2010-03-12\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1215006,\"name\":\"John Behring\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/haJRuL73XiIMrFBahiZfaFql0gA.jpg\"},{\"id\":15912,\"name\":\"Stephen Gyllenhaal\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7T7Ol9ceJvCW9iCEhp5DxbKpfpg.jpg\"},{\"id\":1218785,\"name\":\"Alex Zakrzewski\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/10GE6tUYXEY3oE2j9uBRiSYkJ1U.jpg\"},{\"id\":75631,\"name\":\"J. Miller Tobin\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1218791,\"name\":\"Dennis Smith\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cxsDfWfVvHQK81u04124mDJVMkJ.jpg\"},{\"id\":109537,\"name\":\"Ralph Hemecker\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":70278,\"name\":\"Ken Sanzel\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":417131,\"name\":\"Julie Hébert\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/62gPyUKkQRMxJPvEVGPfUV7AR35.jpg\"},{\"i